// Port of the asecuritysite example to ZoKrates 0.8 syntax.
// y = a*x^2 + b*x + c. Public: a, b, c. Private: x, y. Returns whether y matches.
// NOTE: a proof is still valid when the result is false, so the verifier must
// also check the public output (the last public input) equals 1.
def main(field a, field b, field c, private field x, private field y) -> bool {
    field y1 = a * x**2 + b * x + c;
    return y == y1;
}
